  <vendor email="support@jetplugins.dev" url="https://jetplugins.dev">Bearded Bear</vendor>
  <version>2026.1.1</version>

  <product-descriptor code="PBEARDEDTHEME" release-date="20260311" release-version="20261" optional="false"/>

  <description><![CDATA[
    <h2>Give your JetBrains IDE a warmer, more distinctive workspace</h2>
    <p>Bearded Theme includes <b>65 coordinated dark, light, and high-contrast themes</b>,
    each with a matching editor scheme and the complete Bearded Icons file icon set.</p>

    <p>Every theme is designed for the modern IntelliJ Islands interface, with clear separation
    between the editor and tool windows, softly rounded surfaces, focused tabs, and consistent
    colors throughout the IDE.</p>

    <h3>Meet Islands Moonstone</h3>
    <p>Moonstone is a new IntelliJ-first theme with a calm slate workspace, cool turquoise accents,
    and balanced syntax colors. It is designed to feel polished and comfortable during long coding sessions.</p>

    <h3>What you get</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><b>A theme for every mood:</b> understated classics, vivid palettes, soft pastels, OLED black, light themes, and high-contrast options</li>
      <li><b>Modern Islands styling:</b> polished editor tabs, tool windows, menus, popups, buttons, trees, scrollbars, and status bars</li>
      <li><b>Comfortable editor colors:</b> readable syntax highlighting, inactive text, search matches, and diff views</li>
      <li><b>Broad language coverage:</b> Java, Kotlin, Python, JavaScript, TypeScript, Go, Rust, PHP, HTML, CSS, JSON, YAML, Markdown, and more</li>
      <li><b>Bearded Icons:</b> distinctive icons for common languages, frameworks, folders, and configuration files</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Easy to personalize</h3>
    <p>Select your theme from <b>Settings &gt; Appearance &amp; Behavior &gt; Appearance</b>.
    The dedicated <b>Bearded Theme</b> settings page lets you enable or disable the matching file icons
    separately, with a direct reminder of where to change colors.</p>

    <p><b>Requires IntelliJ Platform 2025.3 or newer.</b></p>
    <p><em>A $1/month subscription supports continued theme improvements and new variants.</em></p>
  ]]></description>

